sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Upload handler (/upload/:id)
    participant S as UploadSession DO (id = uploadId)
    participant K as UPLOAD_KV
    participant T as TOKEN_KV
    participant D as Google Drive

    Note over C: Client chooses chunk size N (multiple of 256 KiB except final)

    C->>H: PUT body (chunk 1)<br/>Content-Range: bytes 0-(N-1)/TOTAL
    H->>H: verify JWT, parse Content-Range
    H->>K: get upload:<uploadId> (pending)
    H->>T: get/refresh access_token
    H->>S: init({ accessToken, totalSize, sha256?, ... })
    S->>D: POST /upload?uploadType=resumable
    D-->>S: 200 Location (session URI)
    S->>S: persist sessionUri & state
    H->>S: receiveChunk(start=0, end=N-1, total, body)
    S->>S: hasher.update(body)
    S->>D: PUT session URI<br/>Content-Range: bytes 0-(N-1)/TOTAL
    D-->>S: 308 Resume Incomplete
    S-->>H: { status: "incomplete", nextOffset: N }
    H-->>C: 308 Range: bytes=0-(N-1)

    loop For each remaining chunk
        C->>H: PUT body (chunk i)<br/>Content-Range: bytes start_i-end_i/TOTAL
        H->>S: receiveChunk(start_i, end_i, total, body)
        S->>S: verify start_i == currentOffset<br/>hasher.update(body)
        S->>D: PUT session URI<br/>Content-Range: bytes start_i-end_i/TOTAL
        D-->>S: 308 Resume Incomplete
        S-->>H: incomplete
        H-->>C: 308
    end

    C->>H: PUT body (final chunk)<br/>Content-Range: bytes X-(TOTAL-1)/TOTAL
    H->>S: receiveChunk(X, TOTAL-1, total, body)
    S->>S: hasher.update(body)
    S->>D: PUT session URI (final)
    D-->>S: 200 { id, name, mimeType, size }
    S->>S: hasher.digest() -> actualSha256
    alt expectedSha256 matches
        S->>K: put upload:<uploadId> status=completed
        S->>S: storage.deleteAll()
        S-->>H: { status: "complete", file, actualSha256 }
        H-->>C: 200 { fileId, actualSize, actualSha256 }
    else mismatch
        S->>D: DELETE files/<fileId>
        S->>K: put upload:<uploadId> status=failed
        S-->>H: { status: "error", httpStatus: 409 }
        H-->>C: 409 sha256 mismatch
    end
